{
  "about": "Requests a student or an admin might make in the web chat, and the tool (and arguments) the first call should go to. A write is a proposal the person confirms, so only the first call is judged. Run with backend/evals/run_chat_evals.py. `expect` lists the acceptable tools; `not` the ones it must not call (an empty `expect` means no call at all). An `args` value is matched as: a number or enum exactly; a string with {\"contains\": ...} case-insensitively; {\"present\": true} only needs it given.",
